                "text": " Write or say what you ate, send it, and the AI works out the food from your words the same way it does from a photo, on the same review screen, into the same diary. The launcher sheet, the dashboard, the diary's empty states and the first-run lesson all lead there. The food database search stays at /add for one exact item. ("
